WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.620
A meeting ends. The record shouldn't.

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:04.940
Tape captures every conversation, however it happened.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.440
English and Chinese become one clean transcript.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:15.530
Recurring meetings become one continuous thread.

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:19.940
Your assistant answers from your archive, with the source.

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:24.740
It sees what you see, and nothing more.

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:28.780
Bilingual meeting memory, owned by you.
